OL,3,GNEWSAHospital trust honours
OL,4,Aschoolgirl's legacy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 10-year-old girl's dying wish to make
OL,7,Fhospitals a better place for children
OL,8,Fand families are being put into
OL,9,Fpractice.
OL,11,FCounty Durham and Darlington NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust (CDDFT) NHS Trust has
OL,13,Fbecome the first in the region, and
OL,14,Fonly the third nationally, to receive
OL,15,FSophie's Legacy Approved Hospital
OL,16,Frecognition.
OL,18,FIt is named after Sophie Fairall who
OL,19,Fdied in September 2021, just one year
OL,20,Fafter being diagnosed with rare
OL,21,Fchildhood cancer Rhabdomyosarcoma.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
